        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/szymo/ontologies/2026/2/CNEEOnt/Anomaly"/>
        <rdfs:comment>A stuck pending state: the ExecutionUnit cannot start because its image cannot be pulled (ImagePullBackOff/ErrImagePull). Subclassed under ExecutionUnitPending (the phase) rather than ExecutionUnitPendingState, so it carries no BridgeOnt scaling restriction; remediation is handled by the dedicated registry-credential planner.</rdfs:comment>
